   Team Lead, Rebecca Gordon (RG) as Senior Gender Specialist, Alessia
   Stewart (AS) as Gender Advisor, and Meg McClure (MM) as Coordinator of
   the Network for Gender Inclusive Democracy. In early 2025, the Donald
